---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/site/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/site/Footer.astro';
import Icon from '../components/site/Icon.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy — Rearrange PDF';
const description =
  'Our privacy promise: your PDFs never leave your browser, we run no ads and no trackers, and we collect no personal data. Read the full policy.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/privacy">
  <Nav />
  <main id="main">
    <article class="bg-canvas-soft">
      <div class="container-page py-12 md:py-16 max-w-3xl">
        <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-body-sm text-mute">
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors">Home</a>
          <span aria-hidden="true"> / </span>
          <span aria-current="page" class="text-body">Privacy policy</span>
        </nav>

        <h1 class="mt-4 font-black text-display-sm md:text-display-md">Privacy policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-body-sm text-mute">Last updated: September 2026</p>

        <div class="mt-8 rounded-xl bg-primary-pale p-6">
          <h2 class="text-display-xs font-semibold">The short version</h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-body-md text-body">
            <li class="flex gap-2.5"><Icon name="check" size={20} class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-positive" /> Your PDF files never leave your device. All processing happens in your browser.</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2.5"><Icon name="check" size={20} class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-positive" /> We have no user accounts and collect no personal data.</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2.5"><Icon name="check" size={20} class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-positive" /> We run no ads and embed no third-party trackers.</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2.5"><Icon name="check" size={20} class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-positive" /> The only measurement we use is cookieless, aggregated analytics (see below).</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <h2 class="mt-10 text-display-xs font-semibold">1. How the tool works</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-body-md text-body">
          Rearrange PDF is a client-side application. When you open a PDF here, the file is read
          directly by your browser using the JavaScript APIs available on this page. Thumbnails
          are rendered and your edited document is rebuilt entirely on your device. No file
          content is transmitted to us or to any third party — there is no upload server to send
          it to.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-8 text-display-xs font-semibold">2. What we never collect</h2>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-6 text-body-md text-body">
          <li>The contents, names or metadata of your PDF files</li>
          <li>Any account information — the tool requires no sign-up</li>
          <li>Advertising or cross-site tracking cookies of any kind</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="mt-8 text-display-xs font-semibold">3. What is collected</h2>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-body-lg font-semibold">Cookieless analytics</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-body-md text-body">
          We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand aggregate usage of the site (for example,
          how many people visit the tool and from which country). This service does not use
          cookies and does not identify individual visitors. It does not follow you across other
          websites.
        </p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-body-lg font-semibold">Standard server logs</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-body-md text-body">
          Like every website, our hosting provider (Cloudflare) keeps short-lived technical logs
          of requests made to load the site itself — things like IP address, browser type and
          timestamps. These logs never include your documents (which are never uploaded) and exist
          only to keep the site secure and operational.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-8 text-display-xs font-semibold">4. Verify it yourself</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-body-md text-body">
          You don't have to trust this page. Open your browser's developer tools (F12), switch to
          the Network tab, and use the tool: upload a PDF, drag pages around, download the result.
          You will see that no request carries your file.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-8 text-display-xs font-semibold">5. Your rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-body-md text-body">
          Because we process no personal data beyond the anonymous, aggregated statistics
          described above, there is generally no personal data of yours for us to access,
          correct or erase. If you believe otherwise and would like to contact us, see below.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-8 text-display-xs font-semibold">6. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-body-md text-body">
          If we ever change how the site works in a way that affects privacy, we will update this
          page. The tool will remain client-side — that is the whole point of the site.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-8 text-display-xs font-semibold">7. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-body-md text-body">
          Questions about privacy? Email
          <a href="mailto:hello@rearrangepdf.com" class="font-semibold underline underline-offset-2">hello@rearrangepdf.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
